{
  "schema": 1,
  "about": "Two-family modern Indic matrix: exact glyphs, advances, offsets, UTF-8 clusters and unsafe flags. Inputs cover reph, matras, conjuncts, controls, broken syllables and script-specific composition. Font pins list actual GSUB script tags; this does not claim complete old-spec font coverage.",
